Copyright 2026 Epsilon Research

Extracted and generalized from the Epsilon internal quantitative research
codebase (infrastructure/changepoint). BOCPD follows Adams & MacKay (2007),
"Bayesian Online Changepoint Detection"; the Student-t posterior predictive
follows Murphy (2007), "Conjugate Bayesian analysis of the Gaussian
distribution". The in-package skills installer pattern is adapted from
goldmansachs/gs-quant (Apache-2.0).
